# Project: AI-Powered Document-to-Web-Form Automation Agent

## 1. Project Overview

I want to build a web application that automates website registration and form-filling processes using information extracted from uploaded documents, such as admission application PDFs.

The application should have a **split-screen interface** with two main panels:

- **Left Panel — Document Processing & Agent Workflow:** Users can upload their documents, view extracted information, resolve missing or unclear details, validate the data, and monitor the progress of each automation step.
- **Right Panel — Live Browser Automation:** An embedded browser should open the target website and visually demonstrate how the configured AI agent navigates the website, identifies form fields, fills in information, and verifies the completed form.

The goal is to create a transparent, interactive experience where users can see both the document-processing workflow and the agent's browser automation progress in real time.

